{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/9db9a524ad17b84f17b64f334a034625.poster.avif?t=1773411186\" width=1170 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/9db9a524ad17b84f17b64f334a034625.webm?t=1773411186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/9db9a524ad17b84f17b64f334a034625.mp4?t=1773411186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.poster.avif?t=1773411186\" width=800 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.webm?t=1773411186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience deckbuilding without energy or action points</strong>\u00a0\u2013 play your cards using physical space. There's no limit to how many cards you can play, as long as they fit! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.poster.avif?t=1773411186\" width=800 height=387 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.webm?t=1773411186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu